. Gorillium Reborn also features a Sandbox mode where gorillas can build, experiment, and create their own fun experiences. Construct obstacles, design play areas, or simply mess around with friends using your imagination.", "short_description": "Gorillium Reborn is a Gorilla Tag fan game featuring Gorilla tag  movement, multiple maps like Forest, Ravine, and Market, plus a Sandbox mode where Gorillas  can build and create their own fun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorilliumreborn-privacy-policy?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tinyhuman007", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorilliumreborn-privacy-policy?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25713743924975534"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830428_930098446184042_3408811926665555991_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y4utGpdHgg0Q7kNvwGQaGPz&_nc_oc=AdpXn4mIISNiB33k4_3yqcwqTdZD235oGmsJ4nDJNE1Zf_nu_6pmKTbTC8IB7f_Rnm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUWtJop86BZ10cXmDCWbJSbB9VvzhdgU1M8QsBaiI5JIg&oe=6B103CCE"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_val